{"id":"evidente","lemma":"evidente","pos":"adj","rank":2816,"glosses":["obvious, evident, apparent, clear"],"ipa":"/ebiˈdente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"evidentes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-evidente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es evidente que él tiene razón.","en":"It is obvious that he is right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526656","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"reason"}]},{"text":"Estaba preocupado por razones evidentes.","en":"I was concerned for obvious reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505870","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"worried, concerned"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"reason","l":"razón"},null]},{"text":"Es evidente que eso es una mentira.","en":"It's obvious that's a lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767677","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"lie, trick, falsity"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"that's it"]]},{"text":"La contradicción era evidente.","en":"The contradiction was obvious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567248","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"contradiction"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Era evidente que ella estaba cansada.","en":"That she was tired was plain to see.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied","l":"cansado"}]}]}